    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Conjuration sphere (Spell Conduit), Spell Channel.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> While your companion is within range of your Spell Conduit ability, you can treat it as the point of origin for any class ability that requires a melee or ranged attack (such as a fey adept’s shadowmark or an eliciter’s emotions).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/conjuration#toc106\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
